{%- comment -%}
  Floating Mobile Quick Consultation Bar (D'tale Modern / Homework Living style)
  Provides instant one-tap access to WhatsApp design consultation.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign whatsapp_number = settings.whatsapp_number | default: '919876543210' -%}

<div id="mobile-floating-consultation" class="fixed bottom-4 right-4 z-40 md:hidden flex items-center">
